        "original_id": "036e8f5a-a602-55bf-b356-84e992506056",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of the Philippines, The NorthCap University, Ateneo de Manila University\n- People: Nicanor Tiongson, Ryan Cayabyab\n- Places: Philippines, Gurugram, Haryana, India\n- Topics: higher education, ASEAN Song of Unity\n\nFacts:\n- The University of the Philippines is a state university system in the Philippines.\n- The NorthCap University, formerly ITM University, is an autonomous university in Sector 23-A, Gurugram, Haryana, India.\n- Nicanor Tiongson earned a Bachelor of Humanities degree from Ateneo de Manila University.\n- Nicanor Tiongson earned an M.A. and a Ph.D. in Philippine Studies from the University of the Philippines.\n- Nicanor Tiongson wrote the lyrics of the ASEAN Song of Unity.\n- Ryan Cayabyab composed the music of the ASEAN Song of Unity.",
